#: scenario8:scenario8_4F5BDCA4_5B9A_4278_B8A1_4D70A9C8A4CF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9242e69081f488f12b3c17dd56d4b65ba9e06bcdd7bf7d47e80d5cccf80f9bf7
