msgid "⟪k:0⟫I’d honestly rather set Morgana free right now,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Je préfèrerais sincèrement libérer Morgana dès maintenant,"

#: scenario8:scenario8_3DF8CAA6_7883_4D42_98A5_94ED7084D6C2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 23c3af5ecebe912c2625675433abd40d6175bce0d6a4be35ba88b941c6a4e9fa
