msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Finally resolving to do something about Morgana took a big weight off his "
"shoulders, I’d guess."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Il s’est enfin résolu à agir pour Morgana et ça lui a enlevé un gros poids des "
"épaules, je suppose."

