msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫which, as I recall from Morgana’s account, nearly drained the church of everything "
"it had once."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ce qui, d’après mes souvenirs de ce qu’a raconté Morgana, a quasiment dépouillé "
"l’église de tout ce qu’elle avait jadis."

#: scenario8:scenario8_2FE65475_AEDE_48B8_9A4C_9F63D44F3EA1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ddfa5effb63941c0c092e089d225624a81b33d6f0e4c6e7832804e56f0ed3653
