msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_2FE65475_AEDE_48B8_9A4C_9F63D44F3EA1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫H-⟪k:2⟫Hey, now! No cuttin’ in line, young man!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫We been waitin’ since dawn!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫H-⟪k:2⟫Hé, oh ! On double pas, jeune homme !⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫On attend depuis l’aube, nous !"

#: scenario8:scenario8_6D3F98F4_C6A2_4660_9EF6_330A8CED9EEA
